# Comma-separated tab keys to skip loading. Strategy tabs also
# skip the strategy backend (algo1/2/3), so the client build never
# accidentally runs a strategy that isn't in its UI. Empty = load all.
# Valid keys: simple, filter, silver (aka silvermicro), backtest,
# compare, history, calendar, charges. Only strategy keys affect
# the backend; UI-only keys are informational here.
# Example for the client deployment (hides algos not in their build):
#   HIDDEN_TABS=silver,filter,backtest,compare
HIDDEN_TABS=
